  "body": "Hello. In Android, users have the ability to [control individual \"channels\" of notifications](https://developer.android.com/training/notify-user/channels) from the operating system.\r\n\r\nI would greatly enjoy it if the web had a similar set of capabilities. As a user, I'd be much more interested in notifications, if I had some idea & some control over what kinds of notifications I was going to get & could change them on the fly from a central system.",
